Luna Engine licensing terms
==========================

Required Notice: Luna Engine by Peter McKinney (pmck91), Copyright 2026. https://github.com/pmck91/luna-engine

Scope
-----
These terms cover the original Luna Engine code, documentation, artwork and
examples supplied by Peter McKinney (pmck91), except material identified as
having separate terms. Third-party dependencies and material retain their own
copyrights and licences; these terms do not replace them.

Luna is offered under the unmodified PolyForm Noncommercial License 1.0.0
reproduced in Part I, together with the additional permission in Part II.
Part II grants additional permitted purposes subject to its stated conditions.
It does not change the text of Part I or restrict rights already granted there.
This entire file and the Required Notice above must accompany any redistribution
relying on Part II, including a bundled Luna runner.

